  "description": "YOBGEF crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P 1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C86 H88 Dy4 F6 N6 O20,4(C3 H7 N1 O1). From the CIF bond table, Dy1 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy2 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy3 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors; Dy4 (Dy) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.480-3.905 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 94.09-112.50°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C98H116N10O24F6Dy4. Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
